{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52241","headline":"诗（幷序） 二 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾富有钱时，妇儿看我好。\n吾若脱衣裳，与吾叠袍袄。\n吾出经（一作「絰」）求去，送吾即上道。\n将钱入舍来，见吾满面笑。\n遶吾白鸽旋，恰似鹦鹉鸟。\n邂逅暂时贫，看吾即貌哨（戴密微校作「藐峭」）。\n人有七贫时，七富还相报。\n徒（《大正藏》作「从」，项、袁谓通「图」，不误。\n）财不顾人，且看来时道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}